#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:150
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To enable many of the optional dependencies, review the information from "
"<command>./configure --help</command> for the necessary switches you must "
"pass to the <command>configure</command> script."
msgstr ""
"Para habilitar muitas das dependências opcionais, revise as informações "
"provenientes de <command>./configure --help</command> para as chaves "
"necessárias que você precisa passar para o conjunto de comandos sequenciais "
"<command>configure</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:158
#, xml-text
msgid "Editor Notes: <ulink url=\"&blfs-wiki;/abiword\"/>"
msgstr "Observações de Editor(a): <ulink url=\"&blfs-wiki;/abiword\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of AbiWord"
msgstr "Instalação do AbiWord"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:166
#, xml-text
msgid "First, fix a build failure when using libxml-2.12.x:"
msgstr "Primeiro, corrija uma falha de construção ao usar libxml-2.12.x:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:169
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e '/libxml/a #include &lt;libxml/xmlmemory.h&gt;' \\\n"
"    -i src/af/util/xp/ut_stringbuf.cpp</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e '/libxml/a #include &lt;libxml/xmlmemory.h&gt;' \\\n"
"    -i src/af/util/xp/ut_stringbuf.cpp</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:173
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>AbiWord</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>AbiWord</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:177
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"s/free_suggestions/free_string_list/\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s/_to_personal//\"                     \\\n"
"    -e \"s/in_session/added/\"                  \\\n"
"    -i src/af/xap/xp/enchant_checker.cpp      &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"s/free_suggestions/free_string_list/\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s/_to_personal//\"                     \\\n"
"    -e \"s/in_session/added/\"                  \\\n"
"    -i src/af/xap/xp/enchant_checker.cpp      &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid "This program does not come with a functional test suite."
msgstr "Esse aplicativo não vem com uma suíte funcional de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:190
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:193 blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:224
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:197
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In order to install the local help files, a graphics session is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Para a finalidade de instalar os arquivos locais de ajuda, uma sessão "
"gráfica é recomendada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:203
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish to install the local help files, untar and build them first:"
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja instalar os arquivos locais de ajuda, desempacote-os e "
"construa-os primeiro:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The current version of the docs expands to abiword-docs-3.0.1 and not the "
"expected abiword-docs-3.0.2."
msgstr ""
"A versão atual dos documentos se expande para abiword-docs-3.0.1 e não o "
"esperado abiword-docs-3.0.2."

#.  I had to hardcode the docs version here, as it doesn't decompress to
#.      abiword-docs-3.0.2.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:215
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../abiword-docs-&AbiWord-docs-version;.tar.gz &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd abiword-docs-3.0.1                &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr            &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar -xf ../abiword-docs-&AbiWord-docs-version;.tar.gz &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd abiword-docs-3.0.1                &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr            &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:221
#, xml-text
msgid "and then, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"e então, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:229
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:232
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>sed ...</command>: This command corrects the source for changes in "
"the dependency <xref linkend=\"enchant\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed ...</command>: Esse comando corrige o fonte para mudanças na "
"dependência <xref linkend=\"enchant\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:245
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-plugins=\"collab openxml goffice grammar\"</option>: Build "
"some or all plugins. The openxml plugin enables "
"<application>Abiword</application> to open some .docx files.  The grammar "
"plugin requires <ulink url=\"https://github.com/opencog/link-grammar\">Link "
"Grammar Parser</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-plugins=\"collab openxml goffice grammar\"</option>: "
"Construa alguns ou todos os plugins. O plugin openxml habilita o "
"<application>Abiword</application> para abrir alguns arquivos .docx. O "
"plugin grammar exige <ulink url=\"https://github.com/opencog/link-"
"grammar\">Analisador da Gramática de Links</ulink>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:256
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring AbiWord"
msgstr "Configurando o AbiWord"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:259
#, xml-text
msgid "Config File"
msgstr "Arquivo de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:262
#, xml-text
msgid "<filename>~/.AbiSuite/templates/normal.awt</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>~/.AbiSuite/templates/normal.awt</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:266
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.AbiSuite/templates/normal.awt"
msgstr "~/.AbiSuite/templates/normal.awt"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:271
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:274
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Choose the right template for your language and locale from the list "
"produced by the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Escolha o modelo correto para teu idioma e localidade a partir da lista "
"produzida pelo seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:278
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ls /usr/share/abiword-&AbiWord-minor-"
"version;/templates</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ls /usr/share/abiword-&AbiWord-minor-"
"version;/templates</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:281
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Create the folder <filename "
"class='directory'>~/.AbiSuite/templates</filename> then copy the "
"<filename>normal.awt</filename> you want into it:"
msgstr ""
"Crie a pasta <filename class='directory'>~/.AbiSuite/templates</filename> e,"
" então, copie o <filename>normal.awt</filename> que você queira para ela:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:286
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m750 -d ~/.AbiSuite/templates &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m640    /usr/share/abiword-&AbiWord-minor-version;/templates/normal.awt-<replaceable>&lt;lang&gt;</replaceable> \\\n"
"                    ~/.AbiSuite/templates/normal.awt</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m750 -d ~/.AbiSuite/templates &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m640    /usr/share/abiword-&AbiWord-minor-version;/templates/normal.awt-<replaceable>&lt;idioma&gt;</replaceable> \\\n"
"                    ~/.AbiSuite/templates/normal.awt</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:291
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Change <replaceable>&lt;lang&gt;</replaceable> by the above command to fit "
"the name of the file you want."
msgstr ""
"Mude <replaceable>&lt;idioma&gt;</replaceable> pelo comando acima para "
"ajustar o nome do arquivo que você queira."

#.         <ulink url="https://dejavu.sourceforge.net/">
#. DejaVu fonts</ulink>),
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:296
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you are using multiple languages, you may need to edit the template to "
"use a font with greater coverage (e.g. one of the <xref linkend=\"dejavu-"
"fonts\"/>, because <application>Abiword</application> does not use "
"<application>fontconfig</application> and can only display glyphs that are "
"provided in the chosen font."
msgstr ""
"Se estiver usando vários idiomas, você possivelmente necessite editar o "
"modelo para usar uma fonte com maior cobertura (por exemplo, uma das <xref "
"linkend=\"dejavu-fonts\"/>, porque o <application>Abiword</application> não "
"usa <application>fontconfig</application> e somente consegue exibir glifos "
"que sejam fornecidos na fonte escolhida."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:307
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend=\"desktop-file-utils\"/> installed, you should run"
" the <command>update-desktop-database</command> command to update the "
"mimeinfo cache and allow the Help system to work."
msgstr ""
"Se tiver <xref linkend=\"desktop-file-utils\"/> instalado, você deveria "
"executar o comando <command>update-desktop-database</command> para atualizar"
" o cache mimeinfo e permitir que o sistema de Ajuda funcione."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/office/abiword.xml:313
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend=\"xdg-utils\"/> installed, you should run the "
"<command>xdg-icon-resource forceupdate --theme hicolor</command> command, "
"for the installed icon to be displayed in the menu item."
msgstr ""
"Se tiver <xref linkend=\"xdg-utils\"/> instalado, você deveria executar o "
"comando <command>xdg-icon-resource forceupdate --theme hicolor</command>, "
"para que o ícone instalado seja exibido no item de menu."

